{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1266,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94918835e52431c53b5231cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看见向前迈进的路线了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb8d47da21715d096f5d2e3d3e2d92ec38ff18fb74d669c0acdc10c8706f9c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9aad0db9d8e9a8a049a019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是段温暖又幸福的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abc2d549ae8871b1361a28b7826b80b03369aa45fe8853c0ce9b5a9650007b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cfe89caa50860d3bb95b57f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有带给你幸福吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1add6934120d3fff1ec917166a9090a09dd49e73c48bd3a1638615ed468a22c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea80217a6623231c398732e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と掴んだ栄光…\r\nメモリに刻んだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f8ce955f2ae59f8b39f5ddf33fc062ab8b505a3051b7f4a49c77ff85cb5837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a851b78311cbdd30edc98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目標コンプリート。\r\nこれからも進化してみせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16c36aef0e0722da411aed2286850ccbf25ded51a292492f1618034878bef6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0b6212cd0230cfe31c37b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我们迈向下一个目标吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b67ab8693567f84fb4fd8269f0d865fd60b465230ce8002de1f2ca8dcabb4682",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58578068554d3cb08e3b8d1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获得回报了啊……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a879cf9dbcb8a91253a67bab44429e163a02226462939ff767fab87133ded6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab4dc355ba04fc1db293bd05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是琵琶晨光。请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "832ff66d6a4436d0d01f6ee1baef6ce3deb2e324eb8b34219100c2608736a946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d64e114c07adaf887c83a25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必定会实现──\r\n专属于我的胜利形式！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2edf3d7fb7e3d5e741dede851ea41e8a5c5104f6e2e65f56109496b3ea53ab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3fe107f54472df930493a0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待我有更好的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a485f7cc85c091add45cd3351edc1aff0eb0ffeefc228a8e82a2a89bc09051",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050e7182bd397a36909e34f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来教你最合适的训练法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54fbf929efe194f7612612fd9fc10edcdcc64caa5ff29841ab5214f1d1519035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247c40e198ea584c37f772ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赐予你神圣的祝福吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25025845a7b3df4b8b4f6707ce1a47952bb86fa9229813252b7a44f682209a5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff878593f024135f7b27eef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像能带来更多的幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ee7bb33fd93b5ee554668e18daee273a31786949e8e574c8867c98d89e98ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ad319e3625c8d17d3b5aae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始庆祝圣诞夜的宴会吧！\r\n祝大家幸福──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b4d9cc150a2ff2b72c355faad690b88d7da43091237a7d21ae6158a2345cba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81de6967b700247cd2ede4a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是琵琶晨光。\r\n一起让神圣的宴会开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "359285d072053f1a8ef421f8e266fa89690afbd74b7d940e4331262e11466cb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:623e8d2abbc857ec6872167b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機能向上を確認。\r\n研究の成果、だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9558d7f51c58b0cf9e7d050bd7c45126f651791a597a33752bc8ab6fe7bff564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95585524594ed37ef7dd3bbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パフォーマンス上昇…\r\nアップグレード完了だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16d738806107a41ea9062689a1235814702c26056cbbb8578e4d66b88cbe491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faa4eaf364a4c6dc8265279a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アナライズ、完了。\r\n勝利への最適解…お見せしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7296009eb688747f7ae2b82e79923a53eb6e56c3a6a82f96e059e1896f2e6b74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8bc4c07d28f603b5541579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビワハヤヒデ、起動。\r\n勝利への演算を開始しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b96294c41a4d679b8ab0b524b239dfa9d7d851448bf4a2cfaf5d1661c4bca8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e07e31f774ceebc0598b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f14e9ede388c81be7c62616915591806c6ea995183f0b5fd0fe715098c7722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1414118e4e52e5121570ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是和训练员一起，\r\n做什么好像都会很有趣呢！\r\n我还是第一次有这种感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89da969a158128f7616f1e5e3bf1d280b25cbf927d3254ef035387e318c51756",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119e836254954eb3fcbb6052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87c73674448030810201b02536701821e85b098250d29146354877d722be62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553534ed80dd325b6acc1f94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6751dfe306ea79492d45848f61a94cb9c4ec83cec4d271d8b9dfd75cb5796c29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab21e56fc0736e3d40d0ed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya，绝对会成为\r\n闪闪发光的成熟马娘！所以，\r\n要在最近的地方看着Maya哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20db4e0c5381ac5dab47e210ffdc5aa88ce9beee17dcf4220a807f585d7d4853",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b972f8325eecf27a27dd978e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya搞懂了哦！\r\n做任何事都是有意义的！\r\n诶嘿嘿，我好像又更接近大人了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "618e681bb67534d52842c6ec5594ef583977d7c5f4fb17185abe4e9c70b32081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34a499b154cc29d8f3f5f902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐☆\r\n那个，我们一起去新年参拜吧！\r\n甜酒的话，Maya也可以喝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a714b83e444ca9b64ae90985f7020abe1d5990ec146a83b1420e0ae3c0a3182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9569b4e5989e4bf830c04f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你！这是Maya为你准备的巧克力☆\r\n因为训练员是大人了嘛，\r\n所以我选了最苦的口味哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b330e234dbb959cbaa9bc9ee68c4311d746ca71cf94eef4d63019caa8ef4c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3005c03f0de8089b6d5cbc95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的话……\r\n啾☆Maya的飞吻也送你当礼物吧！\r\n诶嘿嘿，情人节快乐哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "49488637c4fdac90d8c192023a3f0dad94ba95105067df25fbeefaac2dc8eb58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3326671d9d7e5b1cb3a673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕的故事好浪漫哦……\r\n天上的星星也好漂亮，\r\n是感觉有点大人的夜晚呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d72c7fd1824f04958b746c89f6ae40d2510de453509c93a8f896e3150a593159",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19718e5ad58888e2cc7ae2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋☆\r\n大人会做的恶作剧……是什么啊？\r\n亲额头之类的……？呀哇哇……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bc112a204a1b16a34b9d8d49ea8fa775b0e3dafd71dbb4dd5c56b952e1b37b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c9b73d0b079f734b8874e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐☆\r\n用烤鸡、蛋糕跟胡萝卜\r\n来办一个有点成熟感的圣诞派对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8150703a0134ed72346c7382a53397ed463153bca5e963fe103849a46aa073c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d4b8985119c0164ed06952a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不光是期待蛋糕跟圣诞树……\r\n还很期待你为我准备的礼物哦……\r\n我会满心欢喜地等着的……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f663000310c6e9f3e6d767283a339e6dc739f0f0f6bb61363b721c1234136a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6e90acc7675ca5f39ad475",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各个击破～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64870093fb3e447e67bb3a35b7cc40328b079f4332c5a0d3c1b232c345d92d79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709de7eadf7f277f1391bc08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要大扫除，还要吃荞麦面！\r\n还有很多我想看的东西！\r\n新年期间有很多开心的事要忙呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d3791b798ae1ebd37071c174d91bcf23d0ad7579d4256c42d1d971a5970745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce488d24ecfc9d8e33df43bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐哦──☆\r\n我们先去买蛋糕吧！\r\n然后找大家来庆祝一整天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57bc694716cdef27afb415a2f67b098c48dcb916d7b790af5e9e51b2b723b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1be467e4510366c92ffc0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐──☆\r\n礼物的话……啊！徽章你觉得如何？\r\n我们一起去挑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "655956f6708ccd39af53c36e71f253e917cec86f3e834c0dfac8d41154133f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd7bff8036ef99ae3ba97b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离成为成熟的女人，\r\nMaya又更近了一步……！\r\n就照这步调飞～快地变成大人──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb88e24e9007001e7cd63ca2447c5795b3010a2fe5abed3435f2feea5dc100a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1fe24878c01781be076f56e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个那个，训练员……？\r\nMaya想要大人的生日礼物啊……\r\n飞、飞吻之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0bfc3a56e811a49a3c6423d44a74a016aafb54e597ad41709ddc9092b999ee8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a81726f0afeeff2ac8772d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新公告、新公告～♪\r\n我们一起看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2e146807bb4b97d46117ca40133a4e7e62093bf7f12cb421afc73dc53c514e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909cb97445cb6f4c5054c9f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！有礼物送来了哦！\r\n会是什么？会是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "046e169a89290b459891f2a59e3769b96323e1e65327cbda92d83506127c0c3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb48854f158d42692a9d56ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "击落～任务了☆\r\n继续、继续～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225058de79982c4e461e9adf2c5087d5b2746c996586219517334732c0cff35f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:872876b3a0130ab218e5aa4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就快开始了哦！\r\n好期待……！好期待……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c7a2a8185192089fe7bb69f459093d2c6ca030e69faeffd92a913ae034681eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a856760b7d829c46b10e2aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了哦！\r\n以王牌中的王牌为目标，\r\nTake Off！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed7910613adafcfbe8ec1d6b2bd56a928045970f30f73eed6e9f82f252f4c18b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60acdc1374d711431e113ea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇──！我输啦──！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "965170bab2e3768704a569262cfc80df7848874ac325186db043365e873005ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
